    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[260]'
      value: L_21
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[261]'
      value: If you see [][][][][] on chinese or  special languages, do the following...
        /Search  for "TMP Settings"on your browser /Add  NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC
        and NatoSansThai to the "FallBack Font Assets" on "TMP Settings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[262]'
      value: "\u5982\u679C\u60A8\u5728\u4E2D\u6587\u6216\u7279\u6B8A\u8A9E\u8A00\u4E0A\u770B\u5230
        [][][][][]\uFF0C\u8ACB\u57F7\u884C\u4EE5\u4E0B\u64CD\u4F5C... /\u5728\u700F\u89BD\u5668\u4E0A\u641C\u5C0B\u300CTMP
        \u8A2D\u5B9A\u300D /\u5C07 NatoSansKR\u3001NatoSansMyanr\u3001NatoSansTC
        \u548C NatoSansThai \u65B0\u589E\u81F3\u300CTMP \u8A2D\u5B9A\u300D\u4E0A\u7684\u300C\u5F8C\u5099\u5B57\u9AD4\u8CC7\u6E90\u300D\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[263]'
      value: "\u4E2D\u56FD\u8A9E\u307E\u305F\u306F\u7279\u6B8A\u8A00\u8A9E\u3067
        [][][][][] \u304C\u8868\u793A\u3055\u308C\u308B\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001\u6B21\u306E\u64CD\u4F5C\u3092\u884C\u3063\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044...
        /\u30D6\u30E9\u30A6\u30B6\u3067\u300CTMP \u8A2D\u5B9A\u300D\u3092\u691C\u7D22
        /\u300CTMP \u8A2D\u5B9A\u300D\u306E\u300CFallBack Font Assets\u300D\u306B
        NatoSansKR\u3001NatoSansMyanr\u3001NatoSansTC\u3001\u304A\u3088\u3073 NatoSansThai
        \u3092\u8FFD\u52A0\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[264]'
      value: "Si ve [][][][][] en chino o en idiomas especiales, haga lo siguiente...
        /Busque \"Configuraci\xF3n de TMP\" en su navegador /Agregue NatoSansKR,
        NatoSansMyanr, NatoSansTC y NatoSansThai a los \"Activos de fuentes alternativas\"
        en \"Configuraci\xF3n de TMP."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[265]'
      value: Ukiona [][][][][][] kwenye Kichina au lugha maalum, fanya yafuatayo...
        /Tafuta "Mipangilio ya TMP" kwenye kivinjari chako /Ongeza NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC
        na NatoSansThai kwenye "FallBack Font Assets" kwenye "TMP Settings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[266]'
      value: "Hvis du ser [][][][][] p\xE5 kinesisk eller specialsprog, g\xF8r f\xF8lgende...
        /S\xF8g efter \"TMP-indstillinger\" i din browser /Tilf\xF8j NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC
        og NatoSansThai til \"FallBack Font Assets\" p\xE5 \"TMP-indstillinger."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[267]'
      value: "\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E01\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E40\u0E2B\u0E47\u0E19 [][][][][]
        \u0E43\u0E19\u0E20\u0E32\u0E29\u0E32\u0E08\u0E35\u0E19\u0E2B\u0E23\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E20\u0E32\u0E29\u0E32\u0E1E\u0E34\u0E40\u0E28\u0E29
        \u0E43\u0E2B\u0E49\u0E17\u0E33\u0E14\u0E31\u0E07\u0E15\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E19\u0E35\u0E49...
        /\u0E04\u0E49\u0E19\u0E2B\u0E32 \"\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E15\u0E31\u0E49\u0E07\u0E04\u0E48\u0E32
        TMP\" \u0E1A\u0E19\u0E40\u0E1A\u0E23\u0E32\u0E27\u0E4C\u0E40\u0E0B\u0E2D\u0E23\u0E4C\u0E02\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13
        /\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21 NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC \u0E41\u0E25\u0E30
        NatoSansThai \u0E25\u0E07\u0E43\u0E19 \"FallBack Font Assets\" \u0E1A\u0E19
        \"\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E15\u0E31\u0E49\u0E07\u0E04\u0E48\u0E32 TMP"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[268]'
      value: Jika Anda melihat [][][][][] dalam bahasa Mandarin atau bahasa khusus,
        lakukan hal berikut... /Cari "Pengaturan TMP" di browser Anda /Tambahkan
        NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC dan NatoSansThai ke "Aset Font FallBack"
        di "Pengaturan TMP.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[269]'
      value: "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n th\u1EA5y [[][][][] tr\xEAn ti\u1EBFng Trung ho\u1EB7c
        c\xE1c ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t, h\xE3y l\xE0m nh\u01B0 sau...
        /T\xECm ki\u1EBFm \"C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t TMP\" tr\xEAn tr\xECnh duy\u1EC7t
        c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n /Th\xEAm NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC v\xE0 NatoSansThai
        v\xE0o \"N\u1ED9i dung ph\xF4ng ch\u1EEF d\u1EF1 ph\xF2ng\" tr\xEAn \"C\xE0i
        \u0111\u1EB7t TMP."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[270]'
      value: "Se voc\xEA vir [][][][][] em chin\xEAs ou idiomas especiais, fa\xE7a
        o seguinte... /Procure por \"Configura\xE7\xF5es TMP\" em seu navegador /Adicione
        NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC e NatoSansThai aos \"Ativos de fonte
        FallBack\" em \"Configura\xE7\xF5es TMP."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[271]'
      value: "\uC911\uAD6D\uC5B4 \uB610\uB294 \uD2B9\uC218 \uC5B8\uC5B4\uB85C [][][][][]\uAC00
        \uD45C\uC2DC\uB418\uBA74 \uB2E4\uC74C\uC744 \uC218\uD589\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624...
        /\uBE0C\uB77C\uC6B0\uC800\uC5D0\uC11C \"TMP \uC124\uC815\"\uC744 \uAC80\uC0C9\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        /NatoSansKR,NatoSansMyanr,NatoSansTC \uBC0F NatoSansThai\uB97C \"TMP \uC124\uC815\"\uC758
        \"FallBack Font Assets\"\uC5D0 \uCD94\uAC00\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8645518408272877438, guid: 6ca31c49fd6214f1e8bba2eaa30c4988, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'Data.Array.data[272]'
      value: "\u1010\u101B\u102F\u1010\u103A \u101E\u102D\u102F\u1037\u1019\u101F\u102F\u1010\u103A
        \u1021\u1011\u1030\u1038\u1018\u102C\u101E\u102C\u1005\u1000\u102C\u1038\u1019\u103B\u102C\u1038\u1010\u103D\u1004\u103A
        [][][][][] \u1000\u102D\u102F \u101E\u1004\u103A\u1010\u103D\u1031\u1037\u1015\u102B\u1000\u104A
        \u1021\u1031\u102C\u1000\u103A\u1015\u102B\u1010\u102D\u102F\u1037\u1000\u102D\u102F
        \u101C\u102F\u1015\u103A\u1006\u1031\u102C\u1004\u103A\u1015\u102B... /\u101E\u1004\u103A\u104F\u1018\u101B\u1031\u102C\u1000\u103A\u1006\u102C\u1010\u103D\u1004\u103A
        \"TMP \u1006\u1000\u103A\u1010\u1004\u103A\u1019\u103B\u102C\u1038\" \u1000\u102D\u102F\u101B\u103E\u102C\u1015\u102B
        / Add NatoSansKR\u104A NatoSansMyanr\u104A NatoSansTC \u1014\u103E\u1004\u1037\u103A
        NatoSansThai \u1010\u102D\u102F\u1037\u1000\u102D\u102F \"FallBack Font Assets\"
        \u1010\u103D\u1004\u103A \"TMP \u1006\u1000\u103A\u1010\u1004\u103A\u1019\u103B\u102C\u1038\"
        \u1010\u103D\u1004\u103A \u101B\u103E\u102C\u1016\u103D\u1031\u1015\u102B\u104B"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
